      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S NIPPY (4) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (20.39) in a Grade 5 at this track. Should bounce back. TEA ROSE (8) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 5 lengths (20.42) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in three starts. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. DENIM BEACH (7) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.75 lengths at Q Straight in a handy 16.94 beating It's An Ace. Can make it two on the bounce. CURIOUS CAZA (1) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
